[al:新概念英语第二册]
[ti:12. Goodbye and Good Luck]
[00:00.560]Passage 12 | 文章十二
[00:02.570]Goodbye and good luck. | 再见，祝你好运。
[00:06.440]Our neighbor, Captain Charles Ellison, will sail from Portsmouth tomorrow. | 我们的邻居查尔斯·埃里森船长将于明天从朴茨茅斯启航。
[00:13.820]We shall meet him at the harbor early in the morning. | 我们将于明天一早在港口与他会面。
[00:17.815]He will be in his small boat, Top Sail. | 他将乘坐他的小船“上帆号”。
[00:21.810]Top Sail is a famous little boat. | “上帆号”是一艘著名的小船。
[00:25.315]It has sailed across the Atlantic many times. | 它曾多次横渡大西洋。
[00:29.455]Captain Ellison will set out at 8 o'clock, so we shall have plenty of time. | 埃里森船长将于八点出发，所以我们有充足的时间。
[00:35.695]We shall see his boat, and then we shall say goodbye to him. | 我们会看到他的船，然后我们会向他告别。
[00:41.070]He will be away for two months. | 他将离开两个月。
[00:44.120]We are very proud of him. | 我们为他感到非常骄傲。
[00:46.790]He will take part in an important race across the Atlantic. | 他将参加一场横渡大西洋的重要比赛。